2	line	Morgan Le Faye	This will summon a mighty spirit named Thrantax.
2	line	Morgan Le Faye	You will need to bind him with magic words.
2	line	Morgan Le Faye	Then you will need the sword Excalibur with which the spell was bound in order to shatter the crystal.
